-- the claim a class-wide conclusion is usually supported by: that membership determines the hazard among
-- the members for which there is evidence. It is weaker than the class-wide claim and is what the
-- evidence can establish.
DeterminedOn : BScope → BScope → (Mol → Nat) → Type 1
DeterminedOn e s h = (M : Mol) → (N : Mol) → isTrue (e M) → isTrue (e N) → s M ≡ s N → h M ≡ h N
